; M10 rescue card (FAT32), H:/backup.ttl next to the stock rg2_v003.frm.
; BAK runs this for every boot cause before its own dispatch (finding 22 2.1):
; combo (dial MOVIE + shutter fully pressed + POWER), APP header failure, crash.
; Reflashes stock APP + RES; `up` checks header and nUpdateCsum before erasing.
; Never leave this card in the camera for normal use. ASCII, CRLF.

sprintf "up"
sendln inputstr
; reached only if up failed or returned: switch off instead of idling in BAK
sprintf "forcedown"
sendln inputstr
end
